                                                "sense_id": "dd0ef40f-631e-311c-8600-6e97b4e64a1c",
                                                "text": "Down Syndrome (Mongolism) Described first in 1866 by Langdon Down, this is the best known of the chromosomal dysgeneses."
                                            }
